          <div class="about-paper-title">All Leaks Count, Some Count More</div>
          <p class="about-paper-blurb">
            Shapley-DCLR measures what fraction of a model’s decision-driving reasoning is contaminated. TimeSPEC interleaves temporally filtered
            retrieval with claim-level supervision so predictions rest entirely on pre-cutoff evidence, cutting leakage by 83–89% and reporting
            backtest performance honestly.
          </p>
