          <p class="about-paper-blurb">
            GRPO post-training with a two-mode reward: a leakage mode drives post-cutoff claims to zero before a performance mode optimizes the task
            on clean evidence. Leakage falls from 2–13% to 0.6–3.7%, with performance up 6–13% where pre-cutoff signal is strong.
          </p>
